      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "PAW CORNELIUS (8) has a strong overall record having 13 wins and 17 places from 45 starts but was out of the money last time when fourth (30.12) over 515m at this track. Form at this distance is sound. Drawn out but with clear running expected to go close. ASTON COSMIC (4) is a talented type and proved too strong last time to win by 1.3 lengths at Horsham in a handy 23.50 beating Artemis Science. Ran one of the fastest times on the program in his latest win. Leading chance again. INSINUATING (1) has some solid form under her belt and proved too strong last time to win by 1.75 lengths at Shepparton in a handy 25.70 beating Zipping Everdeen. Winner at her latest appearance in one of the quickest times on the card. Makes plenty of appeal if runs up to latest. GO FLASH GO (2) looks an each-way chance.",
